# ==========================================================================
# Collections (visual shell) — Layer A of ezCollections, decoupled from data.
# The data seam lives in modules\collections\core\stub.lua (SEAM: OUTBOUND /
# SEAM: INBOUND). Wire it to ProjectEbonhold.sendToServer / onEventReceived
# to bring the collections online. Open with /collections (defaults to Mounts).
# Toy Box and Library tabs are intentionally excluded.
# ==========================================================================
